WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.033 --> 00:00:00.900
Director

00:00:00.900 --> 00:00:02.302
of the CIA, Bill Burns,

00:00:02.302 --> 00:00:03.937
says he is confident

00:00:03.937 --> 00:00:05.372
that China is considering

00:00:05.372 --> 00:00:06.873
giving lethal aid to Russia.

00:00:06.873 --> 00:00:08.341
How soon

00:00:08.341 --> 00:00:09.342
do you believe

00:00:09.342 --> 00:00:10.643
China could actually start

00:00:10.643 --> 00:00:13.513
providing that assistance?

00:00:15.315 --> 00:00:16.149
Well, first,

00:00:16.149 --> 00:00:17.484
thanks for having me on, Dana.

00:00:17.484 --> 00:00:18.151
The other thing

00:00:18.151 --> 00:00:19.586
that Director Burns, Bill

00:00:19.586 --> 00:00:20.987
Burns of the CIA said

00:00:20.987 --> 00:00:22.922
was that we haven't seen them do it yet.

00:00:22.922 --> 00:00:24.257
We actually haven't seen them

00:00:24.257 --> 00:00:25.358
take a final decision

00:00:25.358 --> 00:00:26.926
to provide the aid to Russia,

00:00:26.926 --> 00:00:28.628
and we haven't seen the aid

00:00:28.628 --> 00:00:29.796
be provided to Russia.

00:00:29.796 --> 00:00:32.365
So we will watch carefully.

00:00:32.399 --> 00:00:33.867
We will be vigilant

00:00:33.867 --> 00:00:34.834
and we will continue

00:00:34.834 --> 00:00:36.002
to send a strong message

00:00:36.002 --> 00:00:38.104
that we believe that sending military aid

00:00:38.104 --> 00:00:38.671
to Russia

00:00:38.671 --> 00:00:39.406
at this time

00:00:39.406 --> 00:00:41.474
when they are using their weapons

00:00:41.474 --> 00:00:43.743
to bombard cities, kill civilians,

00:00:44.110 --> 00:00:45.712
and commit atrocities,

00:00:45.712 --> 00:00:47.047
would be a bad mistake.

00:00:47.047 --> 00:00:48.648
And China should want no part of it.

00:00:48.648 --> 00:00:50.650
If China does go ahead

00:00:50.650 --> 00:00:52.552
and give the lethal support

00:00:52.552 --> 00:00:54.020
that your intelligence shows

00:00:54.020 --> 00:00:56.122
they're considering giving to Russia.

00:00:56.122 --> 00:00:57.424
Can you please be specific

00:00:57.424 --> 00:00:59.192
about how the U.S. would respond

00:01:02.162 --> 00:01:02.896
Well, again,

00:01:02.896 --> 00:01:03.396
you're talking

00:01:03.396 --> 00:01:04.898
about a hypothetical situation

00:01:04.898 --> 00:01:05.932
because at present,

00:01:05.932 --> 00:01:07.634
China has not moved forward

00:01:07.634 --> 00:01:09.369
as far as we can discern.

00:01:09.369 --> 00:01:11.171
We have not seen them do it.

00:01:11.171 --> 00:01:13.940
And I would prefer to keep our messages

00:01:13.940 --> 00:01:15.408
to China on this question,

00:01:15.408 --> 00:01:17.310
what the consequences would be

00:01:17.310 --> 00:01:18.111
in the private,

00:01:18.111 --> 00:01:18.545
high level

00:01:18.545 --> 00:01:19.512
diplomatic channels

00:01:19.512 --> 00:01:20.647
that we have established

00:01:20.647 --> 00:01:22.148
to discuss these issues.

00:01:22.148 --> 00:01:23.183
Secretary Blinken

00:01:23.183 --> 00:01:24.017
saw China's

00:01:24.017 --> 00:01:25.118
top diplomat, Wang

00:01:25.118 --> 00:01:27.153
Yi, just a few days ago in Munich.

00:01:27.153 --> 00:01:29.055
They had a detailed conversation

00:01:29.055 --> 00:01:30.256
on this subject.

00:01:30.256 --> 00:01:31.958
Secretary Blinken laid out the U.S.

00:01:31.958 --> 00:01:33.426
position in perspective.

00:01:33.426 --> 00:01:34.527
And I'm going to leave

00:01:34.527 --> 00:01:37.397
that important and grave

00:01:37.397 --> 00:01:39.632
set of conversations around the stakes

00:01:40.033 --> 00:01:40.700
of China

00:01:40.700 --> 00:01:41.935
coming in behind Russia

00:01:41.935 --> 00:01:43.269
and their war in Ukraine

00:01:43.269 --> 00:01:44.504
for behind closed doors.

00:01:44.504 --> 00:01:45.405
So just to be clear,

00:01:45.405 --> 00:01:46.539
you don't want to say it now

00:01:46.539 --> 00:01:48.274
on international television,

00:01:48.274 --> 00:01:50.477
but the consequences

00:01:50.743 --> 00:01:52.078
if in fact, China does

00:01:52.078 --> 00:01:54.614
this have been very directly

00:01:54.614 --> 00:01:56.850
and specifically communicated to China

00:01:57.550 --> 00:01:58.051
privately

00:02:00.220 --> 00:02:02.222
President Biden has made clear

00:02:02.222 --> 00:02:04.757
in previous reflections on this issue,

00:02:04.757 --> 00:02:06.259
because this is not a new issue.

00:02:06.259 --> 00:02:07.760
We have been dealing with the question

00:02:07.760 --> 00:02:09.162
of whether China might be right.

00:02:09.162 --> 00:02:10.964
But you said this was her trip to Russia

00:02:10.964 --> 00:02:11.998
going back to the beginning

00:02:11.998 --> 00:02:14.634
of the conflict. Right.

00:02:14.634 --> 00:02:15.869
The point I was making, Dana,

00:02:15.869 --> 00:02:16.302
is just

00:02:16.302 --> 00:02:18.538
that President Biden has said previously,

00:02:18.538 --> 00:02:20.273
we're not just making direct threats.

00:02:20.273 --> 00:02:21.774
We're just laying out

00:02:21.774 --> 00:02:23.810
both the stakes and the consequences,

00:02:23.810 --> 00:02:25.211
how things would unfold.

00:02:25.211 --> 00:02:26.779
And we are doing that

00:02:26.779 --> 00:02:28.615
clearly and specifically behind

00:02:28.615 --> 00:02:29.282
closed doors.

00:02:29.282 --> 00:02:31.317
How concerned just kind of look at this

00:02:31.651 --> 00:02:32.652
big picture.

00:02:32.652 --> 00:02:33.453
How concerned

00:02:33.453 --> 00:02:36.222
are you about these two major U.S.

00:02:36.222 --> 00:02:38.424
adversaries working together

00:02:39.025 --> 00:02:41.461
on the battlefield in Ukraine

00:02:41.461 --> 00:02:42.662
and what that means

00:02:42.662 --> 00:02:45.031
sort of more generally about

00:02:45.331 --> 00:02:46.533
the relationships here

00:02:49.235 --> 00:02:50.069
Well, look, the U.S.

00:02:50.069 --> 00:02:50.870
position in

00:02:50.870 --> 00:02:52.038
this conflict is straightforward.

00:02:52.038 --> 00:02:53.239
We're not going to stand by

00:02:53.239 --> 00:02:54.307
and allow one country

00:02:54.307 --> 00:02:55.808
to roll over another country

00:02:55.808 --> 00:02:57.076
and try to wipe it off the map.

00:02:57.076 --> 00:02:57.810
And we're going to build

00:02:57.810 --> 00:02:59.512
and have built a coalition

00:02:59.512 --> 00:03:00.813
of more than 50 nations

00:03:00.813 --> 00:03:02.315
to resist that and help

00:03:02.315 --> 00:03:02.916
the Ukrainians

00:03:02.916 --> 00:03:04.150
defend their own territory.

00:03:04.150 --> 00:03:05.151
China's position in

00:03:05.151 --> 00:03:07.320
this is much more awkward.

00:03:07.320 --> 00:03:07.921
In fact,

00:03:07.921 --> 00:03:09.255
there was just a vote at the U.N.

00:03:09.255 --> 00:03:10.256
General Assembly

00:03:10.256 --> 00:03:11.658
in which China abstained.

00:03:11.658 --> 00:03:13.593
They did not vote with Russia.

00:03:13.593 --> 00:03:15.161
They were one of a number of countries

00:03:15.161 --> 00:03:17.130
that just tried to stand on the sidelines

00:03:17.130 --> 00:03:18.932
when China talks rhetorically

00:03:18.932 --> 00:03:20.166
about the war in Ukraine.

00:03:20.166 --> 00:03:22.335
They tie themselves into knots

00:03:22.335 --> 00:03:23.636
because they know that going

00:03:23.636 --> 00:03:26.105
all in with Russia in this war in Ukraine

00:03:26.239 --> 00:03:27.106
would alienate

00:03:27.106 --> 00:03:27.941
a substantial

00:03:27.941 --> 00:03:29.509
number of countries that they are working

00:03:29.509 --> 00:03:31.711
hard to maintain good relations with.

00:03:31.711 --> 00:03:34.147
So from our perspective, actually,

00:03:34.147 --> 00:03:36.583
this war presents real complications for

00:03:36.583 --> 00:03:37.650
Beijing and

00:03:39.118 --> 00:03:40.253
Beijing will have to make its

00:03:40.253 --> 00:03:40.920
own decisions

00:03:40.920 --> 00:03:41.955
about how it proceeds,

00:03:41.955 --> 00:03:44.123
whether it provides military assistance.

00:03:44.123 --> 00:03:44.991
But if it goes down

00:03:44.991 --> 00:03:45.491
that road,

00:03:45.491 --> 00:03:47.860
it will come at real cost to China.

00:03:47.860 --> 00:03:49.996
And I think China's leaders are weighing

00:03:49.996 --> 00:03:51.898
that as they make their decisions.

00:03:51.898 --> 00:03:53.233
President Zelensky

00:03:53.233 --> 00:03:54.701
is still asking the U.S.

00:03:54.701 --> 00:03:56.402
for F-16 fighter jets,

00:03:56.402 --> 00:03:57.003
but President

00:03:57.003 --> 00:03:58.171
Biden said on Friday

00:03:58.171 --> 00:04:00.940
that Ukraine doesn't need the F-16s.

00:04:00.940 --> 00:04:04.477
Now, I know you said that Ukraine doesn't

00:04:04.477 --> 00:04:05.311
have the training

00:04:05.311 --> 00:04:06.446
and the maintenance capacity

00:04:06.446 --> 00:04:07.447
to use the jets,

00:04:07.447 --> 00:04:08.948
but is the real reason

00:04:08.948 --> 00:04:10.850
you're not giving Ukraine these jets

00:04:10.850 --> 00:04:12.418
because you're trying to balance

00:04:12.418 --> 00:04:14.153
how far to go in

00:04:14.153 --> 00:04:15.154
supporting Ukraine

00:04:15.154 --> 00:04:17.323
without antagonizing Russia too much

00:04:19.926 --> 00:04:21.227
The real reason, Dana,

00:04:21.227 --> 00:04:23.162
is that we are taking a very hard

00:04:23.162 --> 00:04:24.297
look at what it is

00:04:24.297 --> 00:04:26.132
that Ukraine needs for the immediate

00:04:26.132 --> 00:04:27.567
phase of the war that we're in.

00:04:27.567 --> 00:04:30.236
In this phase of the war requires tanks,

00:04:30.536 --> 00:04:31.471
infantry fighting

00:04:31.471 --> 00:04:32.939
vehicles, armored personnel

00:04:32.939 --> 00:04:35.241
carriers, artillery,

00:04:35.241 --> 00:04:36.809
tactical air defense systems,

00:04:36.809 --> 00:04:38.244
so that Ukrainian fighters

00:04:38.244 --> 00:04:39.946
can retake territory

00:04:39.946 --> 00:04:41.714
that Russia currently occupies.

00:04:41.714 --> 00:04:44.450
F-16s are a question for a later time.

00:04:44.450 --> 00:04:44.984
And that's why

00:04:44.984 --> 00:04:47.086
President Biden said that for now,

00:04:47.086 --> 00:04:49.022
he's not moving forward with those.

00:04:49.022 --> 00:04:51.691
So as far as we're concerned, the U.S.

00:04:51.691 --> 00:04:54.060
effort has got to be to get Ukraine

00:04:54.060 --> 00:04:54.961
the tools

00:04:54.961 --> 00:04:57.330
it needs for the mission at hand.

00:04:57.330 --> 00:04:58.798
And the mission at hand

00:04:58.798 --> 00:05:00.300
is to have a successful counter

00:05:00.300 --> 00:05:01.868
offensive where Ukraine is able

00:05:01.868 --> 00:05:03.870
to take back its own territory

00:05:03.870 --> 00:05:05.471
away from the hands of the Russians.

00:05:05.471 --> 00:05:07.507
So you're not ruling out giving

00:05:07.507 --> 00:05:09.776
Ukraine the F-16s at a later time?

00:05:11.978 --> 00:05:12.612
What President

00:05:12.612 --> 00:05:14.614
Biden said is

00:05:14.614 --> 00:05:16.549
what goes across the administration.

00:05:16.549 --> 00:05:17.517
And he was very clear.

00:05:17.517 --> 00:05:19.185
He said, I'm ruling them out for now.

00:05:19.185 --> 00:05:19.852
Got it.

00:05:19.986 --> 00:05:21.587
I want to ask about Crimea.

00:05:21.587 --> 00:05:22.889
Today marks exactly

00:05:22.889 --> 00:05:24.390
nine years since Russia

00:05:24.390 --> 00:05:26.359
illegally annexed Crimea.

00:05:26.359 --> 00:05:27.427
The Biden administration

00:05:27.427 --> 00:05:28.261
still repeatedly

00:05:28.261 --> 00:05:30.730
says that Crimea is part of Ukraine.

00:05:30.730 --> 00:05:33.232
You also say that Ukraine gets to define

00:05:33.232 --> 00:05:34.801
what victory look looks like.

00:05:34.801 --> 00:05:36.903
So why don't you just sort of give a yes

00:05:36.903 --> 00:05:37.837
or no answer to this?

00:05:37.837 --> 00:05:39.105
If Ukraine decided

00:05:39.105 --> 00:05:41.541
that victory means recapturing

00:05:41.541 --> 00:05:43.009
Crimea militarily

00:05:43.009 --> 00:05:45.211
with the United States support, that

00:05:48.314 --> 00:05:49.816
Dan, I can't give a yes

00:05:49.816 --> 00:05:50.616
or no

00:05:50.616 --> 00:05:51.317
answer to

00:05:51.317 --> 00:05:52.852
what is a hypothetical question

00:05:52.852 --> 00:05:53.619
right now.

00:05:53.619 --> 00:05:55.555
What President Zelensky is focused on

00:05:55.555 --> 00:05:56.622
is getting into the best

00:05:56.622 --> 00:05:58.725
possible position on the battlefield

00:05:58.725 --> 00:05:59.492
so that he can be

00:05:59.492 --> 00:06:00.960
in the best possible position

00:06:00.960 --> 00:06:02.161
at the negotiating table.

00:06:02.161 --> 00:06:03.229
And he spoke as recently

00:06:03.229 --> 00:06:05.231
as this week about diplomacy.

00:06:05.231 --> 00:06:07.200
We want to help Ukraine

00:06:07.200 --> 00:06:08.935
turn battlefield gains

00:06:08.935 --> 00:06:10.503
into diplomatic leverage.

00:06:10.503 --> 00:06:11.604
And that requires us

00:06:11.604 --> 00:06:13.439
to give them the military assistance

00:06:13.439 --> 00:06:15.375
they need to make those gains.

00:06:15.375 --> 00:06:17.043
What ultimately happens

00:06:17.043 --> 00:06:19.846
with Crimea in the context of this war

00:06:19.846 --> 00:06:21.414
and a settlement of this war

00:06:21.414 --> 00:06:22.982
is something for the Ukrainians

00:06:22.982 --> 00:06:23.916
to determine

00:06:23.916 --> 00:06:25.651
with the support of the United States.

00:06:25.651 --> 00:06:26.586
But I'm just not going

00:06:26.586 --> 00:06:28.121
to get into hypothetical questions,

00:06:28.121 --> 00:06:30.123
because what we're facing today

00:06:30.123 --> 00:06:31.324
is a counteroffensive

00:06:31.324 --> 00:06:32.825
in the east, in the south,

00:06:32.825 --> 00:06:33.359
that we need

00:06:33.359 --> 00:06:34.894
to give them the tools to fight.

00:06:34.894 --> 00:06:36.062
And we are doing that.

00:06:37.063 --> 00:06:38.030
You know, you're talking

00:06:38.030 --> 00:06:39.932
about supporting Ukraine

00:06:39.932 --> 00:06:40.166
and you're

00:06:40.166 --> 00:06:41.701
talking about them

00:06:41.701 --> 00:06:42.535
taking the lead

00:06:42.535 --> 00:06:43.970
on how they define victory,

00:06:43.970 --> 00:06:45.972
which is understandable. It's their war.

00:06:46.372 --> 00:06:47.874
But the administration

00:06:47.874 --> 00:06:49.308
is also promising them

00:06:49.308 --> 00:06:51.010
that America will support them

00:06:51.010 --> 00:06:52.412
as long as it takes.

00:06:52.412 --> 00:06:54.080
Can you level with the American people

00:06:54.080 --> 00:06:56.282
about what expectations should be?

00:06:56.282 --> 00:06:59.585
Could there still be a full blown war

00:06:59.585 --> 00:07:00.420
going on a year

00:07:00.420 --> 00:07:00.820
from now

00:07:00.820 --> 00:07:01.954
on the second anniversary

00:07:01.954 --> 00:07:02.889
that the US

00:07:02.889 --> 00:07:04.824
is still supporting at the levels

00:07:04.824 --> 00:07:06.192
it is now

00:07:08.494 --> 00:07:09.262
I can level

00:07:09.262 --> 00:07:11.330
with the American people in saying

00:07:11.330 --> 00:07:13.232
that war is unpredictable.

00:07:13.232 --> 00:07:14.367
One year ago,

00:07:14.367 --> 00:07:16.736
we were all bracing for the fall of Kiev

00:07:16.736 --> 00:07:18.304
in the matter in a matter of days.

00:07:18.304 --> 00:07:19.572
One year later,

00:07:19.572 --> 00:07:20.773
Joe Biden was standing

00:07:20.773 --> 00:07:21.307
with President

00:07:21.307 --> 00:07:22.442
Zelensky in Kiev,

00:07:22.442 --> 00:07:23.843
declaring The Kiev stands.

00:07:23.843 --> 00:07:25.878
So I cannot predict the future

00:07:26.212 --> 00:07:27.346
and nor can anyone else.

00:07:27.346 --> 00:07:27.814
And anyone

00:07:27.814 --> 00:07:28.815
who is suggesting

00:07:28.815 --> 00:07:30.349
they can define for you

00:07:30.349 --> 00:07:32.351
how and when this war will end

00:07:32.351 --> 00:07:34.520
is not leveling with the American people

00:07:34.520 --> 00:07:35.488
or anyone else.

00:07:35.488 --> 00:07:36.355
What I can say

00:07:36.355 --> 00:07:37.623
is that the United States

00:07:37.623 --> 00:07:39.692
is going to continue to marshal

00:07:39.692 --> 00:07:41.994
this wide international coalition

00:07:41.994 --> 00:07:42.929
of countries

00:07:42.929 --> 00:07:44.063
to provide Ukraine

00:07:44.063 --> 00:07:45.298
with the tools that it needs

00:07:45.298 --> 00:07:46.499
to defend itself.

00:07:46.499 --> 00:07:47.767
And to take back territory

00:07:47.767 --> 00:07:49.302
that the Russians have occupied.

00:07:49.302 --> 00:07:51.070
And we are prepared to do that.

00:07:51.070 --> 00:07:52.672
We have the staying power for that.

00:07:52.672 --> 00:07:54.774
We have proven we can sustain unity.

00:07:55.007 --> 00:07:55.808
We have proven

00:07:55.808 --> 00:07:57.810
that we can sustain this level of effort.

00:07:57.810 --> 00:07:58.611
And President Biden

00:07:58.611 --> 00:08:00.780
went to Key to indicate that our support

00:08:00.780 --> 00:08:01.681
will be unwavering.

00:08:01.681 --> 00:08:02.648
Before I let you go,

00:08:02.648 --> 00:08:04.450
I want to ask about a new Wall Street

00:08:04.450 --> 00:08:06.152
Journal report out this morning

00:08:06.152 --> 00:08:08.287
that a classified intelligence report

00:08:08.554 --> 00:08:09.522
from the Department

00:08:09.522 --> 00:08:10.556
of Energy

00:08:10.556 --> 00:08:13.059
concludes that the coronavirus pandemic

00:08:13.292 --> 00:08:16.128
most likely did not emerge naturally,

00:08:16.395 --> 00:08:18.564
but it did come from a laboratory leak.

00:08:19.131 --> 00:08:20.099
Did the coronavirus

00:08:20.099 --> 00:08:21.534
pandemic start in a lab?

00:08:21.534 --> 00:08:22.902
Is that what you believe now?

00:08:25.071 --> 00:08:25.271
Well,

00:08:25.271 --> 00:08:26.372
Dana, there is

00:08:26.372 --> 00:08:27.240
a variety of views

00:08:27.240 --> 00:08:28.441
in the intelligence community.

00:08:28.441 --> 00:08:29.275
Some elements

00:08:29.275 --> 00:08:30.443
of the intelligence community

00:08:30.443 --> 00:08:32.011
have reached conclusions on one side,

00:08:32.011 --> 00:08:32.912
some on the other.

00:08:32.912 --> 00:08:34.113
A number of them have said

00:08:34.113 --> 00:08:35.781
they just don't have enough information

00:08:35.781 --> 00:08:36.949
to be sure.

00:08:36.949 --> 00:08:38.184
Here's what I can tell you.

00:08:38.184 --> 00:08:40.953
President Biden has directed repeatedly

00:08:41.554 --> 00:08:42.388
every element

00:08:42.388 --> 00:08:43.589
of our intelligence community

00:08:43.589 --> 00:08:45.491
to put effort and resources behind

00:08:45.491 --> 00:08:47.226
getting to the bottom of this question.

00:08:47.226 --> 00:08:48.661
And one of the things

00:08:48.661 --> 00:08:50.696
in that Wall Street Journal report,

00:08:50.696 --> 00:08:52.532
which I can't confirm or deny,

00:08:52.532 --> 00:08:54.467
but I will say the reference

00:08:54.467 --> 00:08:55.635
to the Department of Energy,

00:08:55.635 --> 00:08:56.335
President Biden

00:08:56.335 --> 00:08:58.304
specifically requested

00:08:58.304 --> 00:08:59.605
that the national labs,

00:08:59.605 --> 00:09:00.840
which are part of the Department

00:09:00.840 --> 00:09:01.607
of Energy,

00:09:01.607 --> 00:09:03.509
be brought into this assessment

00:09:03.509 --> 00:09:06.379
because he wants to put every tool

00:09:06.679 --> 00:09:07.880
at use

00:09:07.880 --> 00:09:08.314
to be able

00:09:08.314 --> 00:09:10.249
to figure out what happened here.

00:09:10.249 --> 00:09:11.450
And if we gain

00:09:11.450 --> 00:09:13.219
any further insider information,

00:09:13.219 --> 00:09:14.887
we will share it with Congress

00:09:14.887 --> 00:09:15.588
and we will share it

00:09:15.588 --> 00:09:16.622
with the American people.

00:09:16.622 --> 00:09:17.690
But right now,

00:09:17.690 --> 00:09:19.592
there is not a definitive answer

00:09:19.592 --> 00:09:21.027
that has emerged from the intelligence

00:09:21.027 --> 00:09:22.228
community on this question.

